WEBVTT

NOTE
Canonical written narration timed from the exact local narration render receipt.
Pronunciation-only substitutions are intentionally absent from caption text.

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.320
This chapter asks a specific question: A self-improving stack needs to

2
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:08.581
decide which data and feedback may enter future learning without confusing

3
00:00:08.581 --> 00:00:12.454
an intake decision with a capability result, a privacy guarantee,

4
00:00:12.454 --> 00:00:15.940
or proof that a model has forgotten a record.

5
00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:22.607
The tempting shortcut is insufficient: Training corpora, synthetic-data pipelines, replay buffers,

6
00:00:22.607 --> 00:00:28.358
and deletion requests are often handled as separate operational concerns,

7
00:00:28.358 --> 00:00:33.535
leaving provenance, contamination control, retention, distributional trade-offs, downstream descendants,

8
00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:37.205
and evidence effects without one governable lifecycle.

9
00:00:37.805 --> 00:00:43.634
The chapter's core claim is this: Data Engines, Continual Learning,

10
00:00:43.634 --> 00:00:50.047
and Unlearning owns a datum-, cohort-, provenance-, rights-, split-, contamination-, learning-lane-,

11
00:00:50.047 --> 00:00:54.710
retention-, checkpoint-authority-, full-state-inventory-, descendant-, deletion-request-, claim-axis-, consumer-, environment-,

12
00:00:55.050 --> 00:01:01.930
and time-specific Data-and-Descendant Custody Lease: before learning or deletion,

13
00:01:01.930 --> 00:01:09.575
it binds admissible use, evaluation exclusions, synthetic and transformation lineage,

14
00:01:09.575 --> 00:01:16.455
coverage and distribution residuals, model/optimizer/scheduler/RNG/cache/backup/descendant state, prospective checkpoint authority,

15
00:01:16.795 --> 00:01:22.633
retention and replay, deletion propagation, verification, rollback, expiry, and terminal custody;

16
00:01:22.633 --> 00:01:28.470
behavioral cohort change, causal influence reduction, privacy leakage reduction, lineage invalidation,

17
00:01:28.470 --> 00:01:33.777
legal compliance, and storage or backup erasure remain separate claims,

18
00:01:33.777 --> 00:01:35.900
and no receipt, checksum,

19
00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:42.633
exclusion, invalidation, benchmark score, rollback match, or synthetic campaign alone establishes

20
00:01:42.633 --> 00:01:46.120
model quality, forgetting, privacy, erasure, safety.

21
00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:50.750
A concrete implementation trace makes the proposal testable.

22
00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:56.874
The exact current minimum preserves all fifteen legacy data-admission, full-state,

23
00:01:56.874 --> 00:02:01.501
and unlearning-claim route theorems; the four-scenario admission probe;

24
00:02:01.501 --> 00:02:07.863
the 24-surface/15-transaction full-state bridge; and the three-seed/twelve-arm small-model update result inside

25
00:02:07.863 --> 00:02:09.020
an eight-stage,

26
00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:16.500
82-route custody/update/deletion lifecycle with two composed Lean traces, 96/96 route mutations,

27
00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:23.641
3/3 cross-stage mutations, one bounded custody handoff, and one protocol-version-2 readmission

28
00:02:23.641 --> 00:02:24.290
witness.

29
00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:31.880
Influence remains unestablished, storage erasure remains zero, all four affected claims

30
00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:38.471
remain no-change, and no source/rights truth, semantic contamination, foundation-model learning,

31
00:02:38.471 --> 00:02:43.085
privacy/legal/backup/external-descendant erasure, production rollback, transfer, chapter-core transition,

32
00:02:43.425 --> 00:02:45.455
or SOTA result exists.

33
00:02:46.055 --> 00:02:51.872
The design can still fail. Provenance laundering relabels transformed, distilled, generated,

34
00:02:51.872 --> 00:02:57.160
retrieved, replayed, inferred, or mixed data as origin-complete source material.

35
00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:02.256
Metadata theater treats a valid schema, checksum, license field,

36
00:03:02.256 --> 00:03:08.070
or PROV/Croissant-shaped record as proof of integrity, representativeness, lawful use, fitness,

37
00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:09.655
privacy, or safety.

38
00:03:09.995 --> 00:03:16.663
Exact-overlap checks miss semantic leakage, benchmark memorization, near duplicates, indirect exposure,

39
00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:20.300
contamination, subgroup loss, or distribution shift.

40
00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:26.271
Synthetic replacement collapses coverage and tails, while indiscriminate accumulation retains poisoned,

41
00:03:26.271 --> 00:03:31.903
private, obsolete, low-quality, or revoked material. The correct response is to

42
00:03:31.903 --> 00:03:37.534
stop, narrow, quarantine, compensate, or retain an owned residual rather than

43
00:03:37.534 --> 00:03:39.070
narrate uncertainty away.

44
00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:44.716
This chapter remains Design rationale at argument support. Its contracts, examples,

45
00:03:44.716 --> 00:03:48.845
